From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: denfry <dabinayo@pm.me>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:04:31 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Borrow regions for global tasks of plugins in compatibility
 mode

Plugins in compatibility mode borrow the regions they touch only from
BukkitScheduler tasks and commands. Some of them, or libraries they
shade, detect Folia and use the GlobalRegionScheduler instead, and then
touch entities in every region from the global thread and fail the
thread checks. Run global tasks of plugins in compatibility mode in a
loan scope as well. Tasks of plugins that support Folia are unchanged.

diff --git a/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/scheduler/FoliaGlobalRegionScheduler.java b/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/scheduler/FoliaGlobalRegionScheduler.java
index c78e3152b695fb19e035987efb3e67b3b97eebdb..5d47e323db3b5fe2edc7f04641fa1a90a070f764 100644
--- a/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/scheduler/FoliaGlobalRegionScheduler.java
+++ b/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/scheduler/FoliaGlobalRegionScheduler.java
@@ -184,7 +184,13 @@ public class FoliaGlobalRegionScheduler implements GlobalRegionScheduler {
             }
 
             try {
+                // Tessera start - global tasks of plugins in compatibility mode borrow the regions they touch
+                if (io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.TesseraCompat.enabled() && io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.TesseraCompat.isCompat(this.plugin)) {
+                    io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.TesseraRegionLoan.runInScope(() -> this.run.accept(this));
+                } else {
                 this.run.accept(this);
+                }
+                // Tessera end - global tasks of plugins in compatibility mode borrow the regions they touch
             } catch (final Throwable throwable) {
                 this.plugin.getLogger().log(Level.WARNING, "Global task for " + this.plugin.getDescription().getFullName() + " generated an exception", throwable);
             } finally {
